SELFTEST(1)

NAME
    selftest - run shipped userland self-tests

SYNOPSIS
    selftest

DESCRIPTION
    Shell built-in that runs the installed userland self-test programs,
    including BusyBox, /proc, /dev, TinyCC, GNU binutils, filesystem, process,
    job-control, memory/accounting, and runtime compatibility probes.

SEE ALSO
    binutilsprobe(1), compatprobe(1), jobctlprobe(1), lifetimeprobe(1), memleakprobe(1), procscaleprobe(1), busybox(1), tcc(1)
